Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:10.40,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:15.82,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:18.41,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The flag that called forth oaths{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:21.33,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}chikai atsumeta hata{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.37,0:01:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep fighting on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.37,0:01:24.08,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tatakai tsudukete iku{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay true to yourself{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:28.83,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"jibunjishin" tsuranuke{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seize it, dreamin' on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:33.17,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tsukami toru Dreamin' on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't lose, I'll never run away{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:38.55,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}makerarenai nige ya shinai{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Transcend meetings and \Npartings and keep going{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:42.06,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}deai wakare koe ikou{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all treasures{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:46.39,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}zenbu takaramono{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:49.60,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Towards the place that has no end{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:52.73,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:57.45,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:01.58,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oden joined the Roger Pirates,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.85,0:02:17.14,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and sailed across the New World
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:20.95,Italics,,0,0,0,,seeking the Road Ponegliffs\Nwhich detailed the location of the last island.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guided by the four Ponegliffs,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gol D. Roger finally made \Nit to the last island!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}People lavishly praised \NRoger's accomplishment!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"To the Land of Wano!\NThe Roger Pirates Disband!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Oden.\NWhat did you think of the last island?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My body still burns with excitement!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh, you're here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what you said to me\Nwhen we first met?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"Turn the world upside down," wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You also said, "We were destined to meet."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the promise fulfilled?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain's...! Captain Roger's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They flashily came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:06:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redtaro asked Roger\Nwho came back from Laugh Tale something,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and broke into tears...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The world went wild\Nover the birth of the King of the Pirates,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the Navy started acting aggressively.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wealth, fame, power...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who attained everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of the Pirates, Gold Roger"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Gol D. Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But being called the King of the Pirates\Nisn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand why the World Government\Nwants to cover up your name like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The world called\Neverything that Roger gained collectively...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the great treasure of One Piece!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But because of your fame,\Neveryone's coming to get you, Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Take down Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Plunder his treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger has everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking back, it has all been miraculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With such a limited life expectancy,\NI can't believe I made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing but gratitude for you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:08:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you speaking formally like that?!\NDamn you, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me blush, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll just say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Roger Pirates are disbanded!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,ROGER'S RECOLLECTION\NON THEIR WAY BACK FROM THE FISH-MAN ISLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will be born...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our ruler will be born...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Another will be born in a distant sea...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even whales are happy to know\Nthat the two rulers will meet again one day...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have been waiting for so long, too...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It will not be long...\NIt is going to work out this time...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}10 until the birth.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}15 until growing up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you talk so deep under the sea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sharley,\Nwhen will the Mermaid Princess be born?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,10!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Voice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's telling the truth.\NSomeone will be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And that person will surpass us...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We came too early...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The One Piece, huh? I \Nwonder who will find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that will be my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have one in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail towards somewhere where there's no Navy!\NI'll disembark first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys! Take Oden home next!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yeah!\N--Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Oden!\NI'm thinking about meeting Whitebeard before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want Izo to return\Nto the Land of Wano, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He meshed with the crew of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.27,0:11:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to take care of White-Kichi-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After some words to Rayleigh,\Nthe longest-serving member known as the Dark King...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger left the ship.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He received a bundle of medicine\Nfrom the ship's doctor Crocus.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was reaching the final \Nstage of his illness...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But just like the farewell of every man,\Nno one cried a single tear.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The King of the Pirates' crew...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...don't shed tears.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:13:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,OFF THE COAST OF THE LAND OF WANO
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still astonishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrecked ships that couldn't \Nenter the country...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.13,0:13:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you catch a wrong current,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the ship will be destroyed\Nwithout getting near the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, this isolation \Npolicy had a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But we must open it up\Nbefore "Joyboy" comes one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,--Take care!\N--Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard! He's flashily walking away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Be well, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am not dying.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So we said goodbye smiling.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.12,0:14:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I will see them again someday!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.42,0:14:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Toki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.78,0:14:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you all, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There, Hiyori! Up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I called you "Father"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've grown so much, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I hope all is well with you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How polite!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.95,0:15:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you be so impolite?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you deserve politeness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.47,0:16:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}! Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you, Otoki-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how popular I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was neglecting the country for so long.\NI thought I'd be criticized more...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank your wife, Toki-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She is a very wonderful person...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,When she recovered from her illness,\Nshe went down
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to the town and helped citizens every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She has never acted arrogantly \Nas a Daimyo's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She labored with everyone\Nand cheerfully shared the stories of your adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Toki-{\i1}sama{\i0} and your children are\Nextremely popular in Kuri now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And they kept saying nice things about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,At some point,\Neveryone stopped speaking ill of your selfish behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! Thank you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it!\NWe really love you! Right, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.41,0:17:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm jealous! I wanna be loved, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku! I must tell you about Izo...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Dog-{\i1}chan{\i0} and Cat-{\i1}chan{\i0} told me!\NI'm fine as long as he's doing well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,\Nwhat happened to Denjiro and Ashura?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.40,0:17:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see them a year ago, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashura became the boss of the yakuza \Nand mountain bandits in Kuri
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep them under control!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.96,0:17:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Denjiro is wandering about,\Nborrowing money and paying it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither wrangling bandits\Nor borrowing money sound like comfortable lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There is another reason that everyone is happy\Nabout your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell the story from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,After you left, we managed to run the Daimyo-less Kuri\Nwith the citizens' cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that must have been hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, how is my father doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun-{\i1}sama{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So he wasn't well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame that I couldn't be with him\Nwhen he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is the Shogun-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s successor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It is hard to understand,\Nbut at your father Sukiyaki-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s request,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.69,0:18:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,that Orochi became...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please lend me money!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I got confused by listening to him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Orochi is like a little brother to me?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.82,0:19:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I only lent him money\Nout of respect for Yasu-{\i0}san{\i1}.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He did not pay me back even a Silver coin!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:20.90,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I also learned that Orochi is a \Ndescendant of the Kurozumi Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:23.04,Italics,,0,0,0,,that once caused some big trouble.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It seems like Kurozumi Orochi is now sitting as the Shogun\Nas a proxy for me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.64,0:19:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure you saw them on your way here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but each region has several weapon factories\Nand people who oversee laborers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And the men of each region \Nare forced to work there
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,earning poverty wages by the Shogun's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?!\NWhy does everyone listen to someone like Orochi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That is because a pirate named Kaido\Nis supporting him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:19:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and he is monstrously strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that,\NOrochi is doing whatever he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.01,0:20:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! We tried to attack Orochi...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.59,0:20:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not tell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, tell me! What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Momonosuke-{\i1}sama{\i0} and Hiyori-{\i1}sama{\i0}\Nout of the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, about half a year ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a man who refused to labor at a weapon factory\Nand his family...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...were executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We could not take any \Nmore of Orochi's cruelty,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.16,0:20:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and motivated by anger, we \Nmarched into Orochi's place
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,in the Flower Capital with \Nswords in our hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But we got outsmarted and\NKaido's subordinates arrived at Kuri at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They invaded this castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and we let them attack Momonosuke-{\i1}sama{\i0}\Nwho is Kozuki's next heir
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,in the line after Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the enemies were taken down by
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu and Dogstorm\Nwho stayed to guard the castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But the one who saved him\Nfrom their first arrow attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...was Toki-{\i1}sama{\i0} who threw \Nherself in front of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.85,0:21:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am deeply sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because our reckless action,\NToki-{\i1}sama{\i0} seriously injured her leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We put your family members' lives in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.28,0:21:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see, Toki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.09,0:21:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, Oden-{\i1}san{\i0}!\NIt is already healed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.11,0:22:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for protecting our child!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.91,0:22:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.66,0:22:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Oden-{\i1}san{\i0}! If you lose your temper over\Na little thing like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.01,0:22:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,we will be attacked again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.38,0:22:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A... A...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A little thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Toki, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.87,0:22:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...have not heard about the \Nstories of my old days?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your old days?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um, since he was a \Nchild, Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0} was known
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.22,0:22:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,for drinking and fighting, \Nand ended up being arrested!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.88,0:22:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a rough neck\Nwho everyone in the Flower Capital was afraid of...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.95,0:22:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand the way Orochi does things!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:23:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys! Protect my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.21,0:23:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect Kuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oden can't tolerate Orochi's \Nevil acts and becomes furious!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.17,0:23:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With Emma, he aims for nothing less than\Ntaking the Shogun's head!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.74,0:23:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When the fate of the Land of Wano\Nis about to be turned around,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.67,0:23:31.59,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}word from the King of the Pirates \Nechoes over the East Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.59,0:23:35.93,Italics,,0,0,0,,and throws the whole world \Ninto rapture and turmoil.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.37,0:23:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Sad News! The Opening of the Great Pirate Era!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.47,0:23:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.67,0:23:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
